BT 1 0 0 1 0 159 Tm /F3 11 Tf 17 TL 24 0 Td -0.032529 Tw (The fieldwork on which this book is based spans twelve years and four archipelagos. I) Tj T* 0 Tw -24 0 Td .740471 Tw (began in the Tuamotu group in 2004, moved to Kiribati in 2008, and completed extended) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.793549 Tw (stays in Vanuatu and Tonga between 2011 and 2015. Across these communities I) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.727259 Tw (documented what I came to call, provisionally, communicative silence: episodes of) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.787177 Tw (non-speech that participants recognize as communicative acts, that carry conventional) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.467133 Tw (meanings within their social contexts, and that can be distinguished -- by community) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.718045 Tw (members, by close observation, and eventually by the researcher -- from silence that is) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.110583 Tw (merely inattentive, accidental, or otherwise meaningless. The typology I develop in Chapter) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.812059 Tw (2 proposes six categories of communicative silence, differentiated by social function,) Tj T* 0 Tw (relational context, and the signals that mark their beginning and end.) Tj T* ET
